			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750080101,
					"content": "Manqu, we're back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080102,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080103,
					"content": "Phew, that sure was one long wait. Not gonna lie, the longer I waited, the more anxious I became.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080104,
					"content": "It was my idea in the first place, true, but if you went into the ruins only to never return, I'd be beside myself with guilt...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080105,
					"content": "Though, if you'll excuse my bluntness, I must ask — surely you've found the token that the Sage of the Stolen Flame left within the ruins?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080106,
						750080107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080106,
					"content": "That was pretty tough...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750080108,
					"content": "Hah, I knew you'd do it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080109,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080110,
					"content": "Look, it turned out to be this disc thingamajig!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080111,
					"content": "No, surely not... a Golden Entreaty!? G—Golden Entreaties actually exist? Incredible! I must include this in my research.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080112,
					"content": "So this thing's called a Golden Entreaty, huh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080113,
					"content": "Th—That's right. Apologies, I'm just so excited. It's said that this was once handled by the Sage of the Stolen Flame himself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080114,
					"content": "For a moment there, I was thinking about what it might be like to keep it for myself as some kind of family heirloom...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080115,
					"content": "#No way! We need it to save {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080116,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080117,
					"content": "I know... But as for clues about the tokens' whereabouts, well, I'm all out. I haven't the slightest idea where the other one might be.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080118,
					"content": "Ochkanatlan...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750080119,
					"content": "#Huh? Forgive my asking, {NICKNAME}, but did I just hear you say \"Ochkanatlan\"...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080120,
					"content": "(Explain that you saw it when you touched the stone tablet...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750080121,
					"content": "Wow, who'd have thought it'd be in Ochkanatlan... The ruins of an ancient city that lies across a narrow stretch of water, north of the Flower-Feather Clan...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080122,
					"content": "If that's where it is, then I am truly sorry, but I cannot help you. Not only does my tribe forbid me to go there, but so does the Saurian Relics Association...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080123,
					"content": "Apparently, it is said that many years ago, some Association members received a commission to investigate that place, but after setting out, they vanished without a trace.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080124,
					"content": "Since then, the Association has steered well clear of anything to do with Ochkanatlan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080125,
					"content": "Don't sweat it. You've already told us plenty!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080126,
					"content": "Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080127,
					"content": "Well, I must thank the two of you once again. I can't tell you how much seeing a Golden Entreaty means to me. Speaking of which, I'd better hurry back and get all this recorded...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080128,
					"content": "#Thank you once more, {NICKNAME} and Paimon. I wish you a safe journey...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080129,
					"content": "#And {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, I wish you success removing the mark of the Flamelord's Blessing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080130,
					"content": "Farewell!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080131
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750080131,
					"content": "Yes... At the journey's end, the place where all souls come to rest, we will meet again — I am sure of it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Manqu"
				},
				{
					"id": 750080107,
					"content": "Tough as a piece of cake.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750080108
					]
				}
			]
		},
